<title>DENMARK: East Asiatic Thailand 1996 profit falls.</title>
<headline>East Asiatic Thailand 1996 profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>12 months to December 31 1996</p>
<p>						(million baht unless stated)</p>
<p> Net result			     245  vs 375</p>
<p> Group net turnover		 3,900  vs 4,100</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name is East Asiatic (Thailand) Public Company Ltd, a Bangkok-based subsidiary of Danish shipping and wholesale group East Asiatic. It said in a statement that uncertainty about the Thai economy did not allow it to expect trading conditions to improve during 1997 but that it planned to concentrate on core chemicals business.</p>
<p>--Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom, +45-33-969650</p>
</text>
